      {
       "code": "print(df.groupby(\"city\")[\"amount\"].sum().idxmax())",
       "say": "Chain the steps to answer a question in one line: **group, sum, then ask which city has the biggest total** (`idxmax` returns the label of the largest value). Pune. Reading a long chain left to right, one dot at a time, is the pandas way of thinking."
      }
