       "name": "df.corr(numeric_only=True)",
       "say": "How strongly numeric columns move together (-1 to 1). **Watch for:** Correlation is not cause. **In Excel:** =CORREL()",
       "code": "print(df[[\"qty\", \"price\", \"revenue\"]].corr().round(2))"
